OL,3,C'I didn't know it'd be the last hug':
OL,4,CHatton's parents reflect on son's death
OL,6,FThe parents of the late Ricky Hatton
OL,7,Fsay they will "never fully be at
OL,8,Fpeace" as they look ahead to the first
OL,9,Fanniversary of his death.
OL,11,FCarol and Ray Hatton paid the
OL,12,Femotional tribute to their son after
OL,13,Fthe boxing hero took his own life at
OL,14,Fthe age of 46 in September 2025 -
OL,15,Furging people to tell family and
OL,16,Ffriends you love them before it is too
OL,17,Flate.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/10
