OL,3,C'I didn't know it'd be the last hug':
OL,4,CHatton's parents reflect on son's death
OL,6,FSpeaking exclusively to ITV Granada
OL,7,FReports in their first interview since
OL,8,Fhis death, the Hattons revealed they
OL,9,Fwere in the process of building
OL,10,Fbridges with their son at the time of
OL,11,Fhis death, after a family disagreement.
OL,13,FCarol says she made an impromptu visit
OL,14,Fto his gym in Hyde three days before
OL,15,Fhis death.
OL,17,F"I pulled up on the car park because I
OL,18,Fsaw his car," she said. "He asked if
OL,19,Feverything was okay. I said 'Yeah,
OL,20,Feverything's fine.' I said I'd like to
OL,21,Fsee a bit more of him."
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/10
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,303,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F302A1789109353
OL,3,C'I didn't know it'd be the last hug':
OL,4,CHatton's parents reflect on son's death
OL,6,FShe describes their final hug as "a
OL,7,Freal proper hug" and says Ricky spoke
OL,8,Fof his wish to meet up with his dad
OL,9,Fthe following week. Tragically, that
OL,10,Fmeeting never happened.
OL,12,FCarol said: "I'm so glad (I got to see
OL,13,Fhim) because nobody knows when it's
OL,14,Fthe last time you're going to see
OL,15,Fsomebody."
OL,17,FRay added: "Carol told him to always
OL,18,Fremember how much we all love him.
OL,26,@tD@ZpmuD@Dpn
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/10
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
