OL,3,C'I didn't know it'd be the last hug':
OL,4,CHatton's parents reflect on son's death
OL,6,F"You tell your grandkids how much you
OL,7,Flove them, you tell your wife how much
OL,8,Fyou love them but I think, especially
OL,9,Fwith men, don't ever be afraid of
OL,10,Fgetting hold of your son and telling
OL,11,Fhim you love him."
OL,13,FHatton was found dead at his home in
OL,14,FHyde on 14 September 2025. In March an
OL,15,Finquest concluded it was not clear he
OL,16,Fhad intended to take his own life.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/10
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
