OL,3,C'I didn't know it'd be the last hug':
OL,4,CHatton's parents reflect on son's death
OL,6,FPost-mortem evidence revealed the
OL,7,Fformer world champion had suffered
OL,8,Fdamage to his brain identified as
OL,9,Fchronic traumatic encephalopathy
OL,10,F(CTE), caused by repeated head
OL,11,Finjuries commonly found in contact
OL,12,Fsports.
OL,14,FRicky's parents say they hope their
OL,15,Fson is now at peace
OL,17,FHis parents admit they are still
OL,18,Fstruggling to process the loss.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G5/10
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
