OL,3,C'I didn't know it'd be the last hug':
OL,4,CHatton's parents reflect on son's death
OL,6,FCarol said: "He always used to do
OL,7,Fthings that attracted attention. He
OL,8,Fwanted to make people laugh and smile.
OL,10,F"But they do say behind the biggest
OL,11,Flaugh and the biggest smile is the
OL,12,Fmost pain. People who lose somebody
OL,13,Fare always saying 'What if? What if?'
OL,15,F"But nobody knows what goes on inside
OL,16,Fa person's mind. People say it's a
OL,17,Fselfish act but you don't know when
OL,18,Fthat dark cloud comes.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G6/10
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
