OL,3,C'I didn't know it'd be the last hug':
OL,4,CHatton's parents reflect on son's death
OL,6,F"We will move forward because I know
OL,7,FRichard will be looking down on his
OL,8,Ffamily. I really believe that.
OL,10,F"We have to move forward, living our
OL,11,Flives, talking about him, remembering
OL,12,Fhim and loving him."
OL,14,FDuring a glittering boxing career,
OL,15,FHatton became a national and global
OL,16,Fsuperstar - a two-weight world
OL,17,Fchampion who was a regular headliner
OL,18,Fon the Las Vegas strip. Tens of
OL,19,Fthousands of his adoring fans followed
OL,20,Fhim to the USA to watch him fight and
OL,21,Fbe part of his journey.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G7/10
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
