OL,3,C'I didn't know it'd be the last hug':
OL,4,CHatton's parents reflect on son's death
OL,6,FAfter crushing defeats to Floyd
OL,7,FMayweather and Manny Pacquiao and a
OL,8,Fshort-lived comeback in 2012, Hatton
OL,9,Fstruggled with his mental heath and
OL,10,Fbattled drug and alcohol problems in
OL,11,Fhis retirement. He spoke bravely and
OL,12,Fopenly about those health issues,
OL,13,Fhelping many in the same position.
OL,15,F"He used to regularly talk to people
OL,16,Fabout mental health, giving them
OL,17,Fadvice, telling them to speak to
OL,18,Fsomebody, don't do it alone," said Ray.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G8/10
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
