PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F302A1789109353
OL,3,C'I didn't know it'd be the last hug':
OL,4,CHatton's parents reflect on son's death
OL,6,F"He gave it with a good heart and
OL,7,Feverything, but I don't think he
OL,8,Flistened to himself."
OL,10,FThe Hattons thanked the public for
OL,11,Ftheir support in the weeks after
OL,12,FRicky's death and admitted to being
OL,13,Foverwhelmed by the huge crowds that
OL,14,Flined the streets of both Hyde and
OL,15,FManchester for his funeral service.
OL,17,FAhead of the first anniversary of his
OL,18,Fdeath the Hattons have called for a
OL,19,Fstatue of their son to be built in
OL,20,FManchester.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G9/10
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
