OL,3,C'I didn't know it'd be the last hug':
OL,4,CHatton's parents reflect on son's death
OL,6,FRay said: "That would be nice. Whether
OL,7,Fit was blue or red, it made no
OL,8,Fdifference. He was a Mancunian."
OL,10,F"I don't need a statue to remember
OL,11,Fhim. None of the family do," said
OL,12,FCarol. "But he brought a lot of pride
OL,13,Fto Manchester and it would be a
OL,14,Ffitting tribute to my boy."
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                   G10/10
